Package: huncMarkovABD
Title: Acute Bronchial Disorder Cost-Effectiveness Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ian", "Cromwell",
           email = "healthyuncertainty@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: An interactive Markov cohort model for cost-effectiveness analysis
    of Lunavar+SoC versus SoC alone in patients with Acute Bronchial Disorder
    (ABD). Implements a 5-state tunnel-state model with 2-week cycles,
    age-dependent background mortality, probabilistic sensitivity analysis,
    and an interactive Shiny application. Developed as a fictional illustrative
    example for the HEPackageR skill validation exercise.
